s/2909710/extras/9e029b53e3a9b747fada22ffb5d7f3aa.mp4?t=1754853672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNRAVEL ARCANE MYSTERIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four Courts and the Major Arcana characters are filled with false prophets, deceptive generals and dishonest rulers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to uncover the secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909710/extras/ff37d6d13e7e50878e41c7f5027961f8.poster.avif?t=1754853672\" width=600 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909710/extras/ff37d6d13e7e50878e41c7f5027961f8.webm?t=1754853672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909710/extras/ff37d6d13e7e50878e41c7f5027961f8.mp4?t=1754853672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own Tarot-deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt the unique play styles of each suit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the Kings and Queens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop Trinkets from the Sun and Moon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engrave Sigils with the Star</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the Wheel of Fortune</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse and Bless your cards with the Magician</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the occult secrets of the Courts...</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "TAROGUE is a challenging Tarot Roguelike Deckbuilder. You are The Fool. \ud83c\udccf Craft your deck, discover synergies, and uncover the secrets of the four factions; Wands, Cups, Swords, and Coins. Dive into the occult and unravel the mysteries of Kings, Queens, and Aces. Welcome to the Courts!",
